  <NAME>C1 analysis using mixtures of human (HEK) and mouse (3T3) cells</NAME>
  <TITLE>C1 analysis using mixtures of human (HEK) and mouse (3T3) cells</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>A cell supsension containing an equal mix of HEK and 3T3 cells was used in the Fluidigm C1 Overall design: Suspensions of 3T3 and HEK cells were diluted down to a concentration of 250,000 per mL and mixed 1:1, then loaded onto two medium C1 cell capture chips.</DESCRIPTION>
